         "InlineFormula", ExpressionUUID -> 
          "44621ba9-e78d-4d63-b67f-172b67f1b099"], 
        " is cached on first call through ", 
        Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{StyleBox["tn", "TI"], "[", "\"Data\"", "]"}]], 
         "InlineFormula", ExpressionUUID -> 
          "02949e1c-450f-42d2-abaa-d11f9583ee07"], 
        ", so repeated access from any of the per-key dispatch shortcuts (", 
        Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{StyleBox["tn", "TI"], "[", "\"Indices\"", 
            "]"}]], "InlineFormula", ExpressionUUID -> 
          "4bd3dd44-e933-4c53-8e51-431fa92307fc"], ", ", 
