          "68e97dbb-bebf-4057-bf6a-5d6df590eea3"], 
        ", which records both the tensor index ", 
        Cell[BoxData[StyleBox["v", "TI"]], "InlineFormula", 
         ExpressionUUID -> "e0d267d4-58fa-4a52-8240-f975d03431f5"], 
